+ * struct omci_gem_counters - free-running traffic totals of one GEM port
+ * @gem_port_id: GEM port to look up, set by the caller
+ * @valid: the MAC counts @gem_port_id; the fields below are meaningful
+ * @generation: changes whenever the totals restart from zero, e.g. when
